<section class="reading-shelf" aria-labelledby="reading-shelf-title">
  <h3 id="reading-shelf-title">继续阅读</h3>
  <p class="shelf-note" data-reading-storage-note>阅读位置与书签只保存在当前浏览器。</p>
  <button type="button" class="text-control" data-add-bookmark data-shelf-bookmark hidden>为当前阅读位置夹一枚书签</button>
  <p class="shelf-note" data-reading-status role="status"></p>
  <ol data-reading-history><li class="shelf-empty">读过文章后，会在这里留下位置。</li></ol>
  <details><summary>我的书签 <span data-bookmark-count></span></summary><ol data-reading-bookmarks><li class="shelf-empty">在文章中点“夹一枚书签”，保存当前读到的地方。</li></ol></details>
  <button type="button" class="text-control" data-clear-reading hidden>清空阅读记录</button>
  <p class="shelf-note" role="status" data-shelf-status></p>
</section>
